'''Keren''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found south of the [[Thunder Falls Raceway|Thunder Falls]] [[Speedways|Speedway]], located in [[Lakeshore]]. She sells exclusively [[Brawler]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

