*{{Member}}[[Stick and Move Brawler Gloves]]
*{{Member}}[[Stick and Move Brawler Boots]]
*{{Member}}[[Stick and Move Brawler Jacket]]
*[[Brawler's Flair Shard of Shattering]]
*[[Brawler's Power Shard of Vitality IV]]
*[[Brawler's Necklace of Vitality IV]]
*[[Brawler's Drill Hammer of Slammage]]
*[[Brawler's Drill Hammer of Dirt Kick]]
